        <definition>void* AVVulkanFramesContext::alloc_pnext[AV_NUM_DATA_POINTERS]</definition>
        <argsstring>[AV_NUM_DATA_POINTERS]</argsstring>
        <name>alloc_pnext</name>
        <qualifiedname>AVVulkanFramesContext::alloc_pnext</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Extension data for memory allocation. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Must have as many entries as the number of planes of the sw_format. This will be chained to VkExportMemoryAllocateInfo, which is used to make all pool images exportable to other APIs if the necessary extensions are present in enabled_dev_extensions. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
