        <briefdescription>
<para>Similar to <ref refid="structAVVulkanFramesContext_1aac1916fd157b6376d6fab74562e6ee31" kindref="member">lock_frame()</ref>, unlocks a frame. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
